{"type":"ring","title":"One lane: deadlock (4-chip ring)","intro":"A link carries data as <b>flits</b>, small fixed-size pieces of a packet (4 flits per packet here). The receiving chip keeps a buffer per link. A packet's first flit, its <b>head</b>, can enter a buffer once the previous packet's last flit has arrived there, so packets queue one behind another and their flits never mix. Here 4 chips form a ring and send clockwise, one flit per link per cycle; each link takes turns between traffic passing through and the chip's own packets. <br><br>With a single lane per link, packets can end up in a circle, each holding one buffer while it waits for the next. None can move, forever: a <b>deadlock</b>. Red arrows show which packet waits for which buffer.","n":4,"vcs":1,"cap":4,"plen":4,"dateline":false,"packets":[[0,1],[2,0],[1,3],[3,1],[0,2],[2,3],[0,3],[1,0],[0,3],[0,3],[1,3],[2,1],[2,1],[3,1],[1,0],[3,2],[2,0],[3,2]],"frames":[{"b":[[],[],[],[]],"q":[[[0,0]],[],[],[]],"w":[],"d":0},{"b":[[],[[0,0]],[],[]],"q":[[[0,1]],[],[[1,0]],[]],"w":[],"d":0},{"b":[[],[[0,1]],[],[[1,0]]],"q":[[[0,2]],[],[[1,1]],[]],"w":[],"d":0},{"b":[[[1,0]],[[0,2]],[],[[1,1]]],"q":[[[0,3]],[[2,0]],[[1,2]],[]],"w":[],"d":0},{"b":[[[1,1]],[[0,3]],[[2,0]],[[1,2]]],"q":[[],[[2,1]],[[1,3]],[]],"w":[[2,0,3,0]],"d":0},{"b":[[[1,2]],[],[[2,0],[2,1]],[[1,3]]],"q":[[],[[2,2]],[],[[3,0]]],"w":[],"d":1},{"b":[[[1,3]],[],[[2,1],[2,2]],[[2,0]]],"q":[[],[[2,3]],[],[[3,0]]],"w":[],"d":1},{"b":[[[3,0]],[],[[2,2],[2,3]],[[2,1]]],"q":[[],[],[],[[3,1]]],"w":[],"d":2},{"b":[[[3,1]],[[3,0]],[[2,3]],[[2,2]]],"q":[[[4,0]],[],[],[[3,2]]],"w":[],"d":2},{"b":[[[3,2]],[[3,1]],[],[[2,3]]],"q":[[[4,0]],[],[[5,0]],[[3,3]]],"w":[],"d":2},{"b":[[[3,3]],[[3,2]],[],[[5,0]]],"q":[[[4,0]],[],[[5,1]],[]],"w":[],"d":3},{"b":[[],[[3,3]],[],[[5,1]]],"q":[[[4,0]],[],[[5,2]],[]],"w":[],"d":3},{"b":[[],[[4,0]],[],[[5,2]]],"q":[[[4,1]],[],[[5,3]],[]],"w":[],"d":4},{"b":[[],[[4,1]],[[4,0]],[[5,3]]],"q":[[[4,2]],[],[],[]],"w":[],"d":4},{"